      "source": "https://www.mtmemory.org/nodes/view/128475"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Riceville sits at 4,195 feet in the Belt Creek valley, just north of the Little Belt Mountains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        7
