      "source": "https://www.mtmemory.org/nodes/view/128475"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Riceville lies in Cascade County’s southeastern part along U.S. Route 89, 13 miles south of Belt and 34 miles southeast of Great Falls.",
